    "Insert/remove the corresponding independently admitted raw primary slot, retaining original source-order metadata and unchanged RapidRT derived placement. Independently audit candidate shape before and after scalar rewriting, then inspect actual staged output and dictionary fields. Output profiles are not original-source certificates.",
    "Bound copied names and both candidate-audit group/span allowances before allocations under100000 rows/64MiB logical allowance. Preserve callback rollback and corrected retry paths; do not claim allocator-capacity/RSS/performance qualification.",
    "Fix the actual adjacent-scope failure: live processRenderSettings bypasses decoder for102 groups, while replay previously invalidated its RapidRT sequence on the opener. Exclude102 from that primary sequence; do not change DWG parse bodies or installed interfaces.",
    "Keep no-preset2D and direct codec consumers compatible. Qualification uses focused owning/replay/metadata/consumer checks after the prior123-test checkpoint, avoiding a repeated broad suite."
  ],
